#: lesson.yml:title
msgid ""
"Alpha-Fold Metainference for structural ensemble prediction of a partially "
"disordered protein"
msgstr ""
"Alpha-Fold Metainference による Partially Disordered Protein の構造 Ensemble の予測"

#: lesson.yml:description
msgid ""
"A tutorial about how metainference can be used in tandem with Alpha-fold to "
"predict the ensemble of structures for a partially disordered protein."
msgstr ""
"Metainference と Alpha-fold を組み合わせて Partially Disordered Protein の構造 Ensemble"
" を予測する方法を学ぶチュートリアル。"
